3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The hero's name was Lumiere Silvamillion Clover.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:27,000
He was later hailed as the first Wizard King, and his story became legend.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Hey there! Guess I survived. Though, as you can see, I'm a bit smaller now.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
