7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Okay, hold on. What kind of wacky plot twist is this?

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
You gave a fancy final speech and everything. Why aren't you dead?

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Thinking you were dead inspired me. Now I feel like I wasted my energy.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Please relax, Yami. I'm sorry for being useless while the Clover Kingdom was in such awful peril.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
