15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Damn it. You're still as baddy as ever.

16
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,000
On the other hand, I thought I'd never see your face again, so...

17
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Guess it isn't all bad.

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Please forgive me, Julius. What I did... was foolish.

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
